{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35855","headline":"吴处士寄香兼劝入道 · 李咸用","name":"吴处士寄香兼劝入道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢寄精专一捻香，劝予朝礼仕虚皇。\n须知十极皆臣妾，岂止遗生奉混茫。\n空挂黄衣宁续寿，曾闻玄教在知常。\n但居平易俟天命，便是长生不死乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35855.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35855","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}